{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0097737","isObsolete":false,"name":"acquisition of mycelium reproductive competence","definition":{"text":"A maturation process by which an organism acquires the ability to reproduce. In fungi, reproductive competence only occurs in a population of filamentous cells that form a mycelium.","xrefs":[{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"23864594"}]},"synonyms":[{"name":"mycelium developmental competence","type":"related"}],"replaces":[{"id":"GO:0043581","type":"consider"}],"history":[{"timestamp":"2024-09-18","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2024-09-18","action":"Deleted","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2024-09-05","action":"Deleted","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2024-09-05","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2016-10-22","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2016-10-18","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"A maturation process by which an organism acquires the ability to reproduce. In fungi, reproductive competence only occurs in a population of filamentous cells that form a mycelium."},{"timestamp":"2016-10-18","action":"Added","category":"TERM","text":"acquisition of mycelium reproductive competence"},{"timestamp":"2016-10-18","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0032502 (developmental process)"},{"timestamp":"2016-10-18","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"mycelium developmental competence"}],"taxonConstraints":[{"ancestorId":"GO:0097737","ancestorName":"acquisition of mycelium reproductive competence","relationship":"only_in_taxon","taxId":"2, 4751","taxIdType":"NCBITaxon_Union","taxName":"Fungi or Bacteria"}],"aspect":"biological_process","usage":"Unrestricted"}],"pageInfo":null}